return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-09T22:42:23+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-09T22:42:23+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A fast, privacy-respecting live chat for your website. Answers visitors with AI when you are busy, hands them to you when they need a person, and emails you anything you miss. Under 5 KB on the page and no requests at all until somebody opens it.'=>'ÌbÌrọ̀rò àti ìfẹ́ àṣirí fún ojú ojú wẹ́bù rẹ. Ó ń dáhùn sí àwọn àpèjò pèlú AI nígbà tí o bá ní ìṣẹ́ lára, ó ń fi wọ́n lé ọ lọ́wọ́ nígbà tí wọ́n ní ìlò ènìyàn, ó sí ń fi ìmélù raǹṣẹ́ sí ọ nítorí ohunkohun tí o bá sì. Ó kéré ju 5 KB lórí ojú èwé náà kò sí ìbéeré kankan tí ó wà tiiti di ìgbà tí ènìyàn bá ṣí i.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Settings'=>'Eto','That does not look like a Zinn® Chat key. Copy it from the Live chat page of your Zinn Digital® dashboard — it starts with zc_.'=>'Ko dabi bẹẹ pe o jẹ bọtọ Zinn® Chat. Da a kọ lati ojú ewé ìtumọ̀ Live chat ti daṣibọọdu Zinn Digital® rẹ — o bẹrẹ pẹlu zc_.','Add your chat key before switching the chat on — without it there is nothing for the widget to connect to.'=>'Fi kọ́kọ́ kún bọtìni ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ rẹ ká tó tan ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ náà — láìsí i, kò sí ohun tí widget náà lè sopọ̀ mọ́.','Live chat for this site. Visitors get an answer straight away, you get anything you miss by email, and the whole thing is under 5 KB on the page.'=>'Lífa ifọrọwọrọ fun ojula yii. Awọn alejo gba idahun lẹsẹkẹsẹ, o gba ohunkohun ti o padanu nipasẹ imeeli, ati pe gbogbo nkan naa wa labẹ 5 KB lori oju-iwe naa.','The chat is live on this site.'=>'Ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ náà wà ní ìkànnì yìí.','The chat is switched off. Nothing is loaded on your site.'=>'A ti pa iwiregbe naa. Ko si ohun ti o kojọ lori aaye rẹ.','Chat key'=>'Bọtìnì ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀','Copy this from the Live chat page of your %s.'=>'Da é kuro ninu ojúewé ìjíròròàyè ti %s rẹ.','Zinn Digital® dashboard'=>'Dasibọọdu Zinn Digital®','Show the chat'=>'Fi iwiregbe naa han','Show the chat window to visitors of this site'=>'Fi ferese iwiregbe han fun awọn alejo ti aaye yii','Until you tick this, the plugin adds nothing at all to your pages — no script, no cookie, no requests.'=>'Titi di igba ti o ba fi ami si eyi, plugin naa ko fi ohunkohun kun awọn oju-iwe rẹ rara — ko si iwe afọwọkọ, ko si kuki, ko si awọn ibeere.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́ni àti àwọn iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́n olùṣlò','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọnisọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ìgbékalẹ̀ wẹ́bù Zinn® fún WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfipamọ́ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣípò padà ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìṣàkóso tó rọrùn fún àwọn tó ní ju ojú opó kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ati ta awọn aaye ti a ti mulẹ, awọn ìpín (domains) ati awọn aye fifi si linki, pẹlu owo ti o wa ni ipamọ lailewu titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba awọn eniyan ti eyi jẹ iṣẹ wọn siṣẹ','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà àwọn alágbàṣe agbaye wa: wo ju 10,000 awọn iṣẹ ti a ti ṣetan lọ lati ọdọ awọn onkọwe, awọn apẹẹrẹ, awọn olùgbóògì ati awọn amoye SEO, tabi fi iṣẹ kan sori ẹrọ ki o jẹ ki wọn bid.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo awọn akọsilẹ itusilẹ Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìgbékẹ̀lẹ̀ ìṣọ̀tún tí a ṣe sílẹ̀ kùnà àti pé a kò fi í sori ẹrọ náà.']];